g></g></svg></mjx-container> with\nrespect to the horizontal respectively as shown in the figure. The speed of A is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.251ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.455ex\" height=\"2.398ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -949 2853 1060\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,89)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"853\" y=\"829\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> m/s. At time t = 0 s, an observer in A finds B at a distance of 500 m. This observer sees B moving with a constant velocity\nperpendicular to the line of motion of A. If at t = t<sub>0</sub>, A just escapes being hit by B, t<sub>0</sub> in seconds is\n<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ky3j9wqd/3118d649-4334-494c-8c94-278f74bf7448/ea2b6250-6f3e-11ec-991e-ef5d44607cbc/file-1ky3j9wqe.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ky3j9wqd/3118d649-4334-494c-8c94-278f74bf7448/ea2b6250-6f3e-11ec-991e-ef5d44607cbc/file-1ky3j9wqe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;max-height: 60vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Motion Question 11 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly